    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/8acab4dcf4de51a9e0baf06fd623bed0.avif?t=1750952363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/64f25bd3bde617dff27b14580873657d.avif?t=1750952363\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, these pathetic humans have survived the apocalypse. But not this time.<br>You are the dark mind behind history\u2019s greatest monster invasions, and now it\u2019s time to finish what you started. Take control of your minions, turn the tide, and wipe humanity off the map. They think they can fight back? Show them what a real threat looks like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess your minions</strong> and control them directly to slaughter as many humans as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique environments</strong>, each filled with deadly traps and relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and synergies</strong> to customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush humanity\u2019s greatest heroes</strong> and make an example of them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massacre hordes of humans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do these weak creatures really think they can rule for much longer? Harness the power of your possessed monsters, unlock devastating abilities, and make sure not a single human escapes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ebbc5080c342cdf19255375e7080b48b.poster.avif?t=1750952363\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ebbc5080c342cdf19255375e7080b48b.webm?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ebbc5080c342cdf19255375e7080b48b.mp4?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your ultimate loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you the chance to experiment with unique upgrades. Acquire powerful singularities, unlock new passives, and fine-tune your strategy to turn your creatures into unstoppable killing machines. Every choice can mean the difference between total domination\u2026 or another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/86c989b34322f32cb3d6ac14773c0308.poster.avif?t=1750952363\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/86c989b34322f32cb3d6ac14773c0308.webm?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/86c989b34322f32cb3d6ac14773c0308.mp4?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face their so-called &quot;heroes&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity won\u2019t go down without a fight\u2014they\u2019re sending their strongest warriors to stop you. Elite soldiers, valkyries, and legendary fighters will stand in your way. It\u2019s up to you to crush their last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ce6fc09cbc6205cfdc2c82cab17a0e21.poster.avif?t=1750952363\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ce6fc09cbc6205cfdc2c82cab17a0e21.webm?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ce6fc09cbc6205cfdc2c82cab17a0e21.mp4?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/64f25bd3bde617dff27b14580873657d.avif?t=1750952363\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, these pathetic humans have survived the apocalypse. But not this time.<br>You are the dark mind behind history\u2019s greatest monster invasions, and now it\u2019s time to finish what you started. Take control of your minions, turn the tide, and wipe humanity off the map. They think they can fight back? Show them what a real threat looks like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess your minions</strong> and control them directly to slaughter as many humans as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique environments</strong>, each filled with deadly traps and relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and synergies</strong> to customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush humanity\u2019s greatest heroes</strong> and make an example of them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massacre hordes of humans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do these weak creatures really think they can rule for much longer? Harness the power of your possessed monsters, unlock devastating abilities, and make sure not a single human escapes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ebbc5080c342cdf19255375e7080b48b.poster.avif?t=1750952363\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ebbc5080c342cdf19255375e7080b48b.webm?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ebbc5080c342cdf19255375e7080b48b.mp4?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your ultimate loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you the chance to experiment with unique upgrades. Acquire powerful singularities, unlock new passives, and fine-tune your strategy to turn your creatures into unstoppable killing machines. Every choice can mean the difference between total domination\u2026 or another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/86c989b34322f32cb3d6ac14773c0308.poster.avif?t=1750952363\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/86c989b34322f32cb3d6ac14773c0308.webm?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/86c989b34322f32cb3d6ac14773c0308.mp4?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face their so-called &quot;heroes&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity won\u2019t go down without a fight\u2014they\u2019re sending their strongest warriors to stop you. Elite soldiers, valkyries, and legendary fighters will stand in your way. It\u2019s up to you to crush their last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ce6fc09cbc6205cfdc2c82cab17a0e21.poster.avif?t=1750952363\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ce6fc09cbc6205cfdc2c82cab17a0e21.webm?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/ce6fc09cbc6205cfdc2c82cab17a0e21.mp4?t=1750952363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "What's more frustrating than watching an army of monsters fail to wipe out humanity? Take control of a minion and turn the tide in a roguelite survival game. Just died? No problem\u2014another creature is ready to be possessed. Keep the carnage going and make sure humanity meets its end!",
